  [PASS] E4i the asymptotic forms fed into E4 (rho = V_f^2/(4 pi G r^2), g r = V_f^2, slope -2 deep; rho = a0/(4 pi G r), slope -1 Newtonian) hold on the ODE solution to 1e-3
         max deviation 9.0e-06

